{"availability":"available","full":"idan-rubin/browserclaw","name":"browserclaw","description":"The AI-native browser automation library. Snapshot + ref targeting — born from OpenClaw, built for agents, by agents.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":81,"forks":7,"created":"2026-02-08T19:16:06Z","updated":"2026-10-10T18:27:54Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["accessibility","ai","ai-agent","browser-automation","cdp","chrome","llm","openclaw","playwright","snapshot","typescript","web-scraping"],"demo":"https://browserclaw.org/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:01:27.125Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T18:01:27.125Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T18:01:27.125Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:13:42.338Z","stars":76,"forks":7},{"at":"2026-10-04T21:35:05.727Z","stars":77,"forks":7},{"at":"2026-10-06T22:53:47.401Z","stars":78,"forks":7},{"at":"2026-10-09T05:46:42.042Z","stars":78,"forks":7},{"at":"2026-10-12T06:28:41.437Z","stars":79,"forks":7},{"at":"2026-10-15T17:01:46.698Z","stars":80,"forks":7},{"at":"2026-10-19T18:01:27.125Z","stars":81,"forks":7}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The browser tool, not the agent. You bring the brain.","The AI-native browser automation library — born from OpenClaw, built on Playwright, embeddable in any TS/Node agent loop. Snapshot + ref targeting: no CSS selectors, no XPath, no vision model — just numbered refs that map to interactive elements.","Most other tools in this space ship a complete AI agent: they take your task, own the LLM loop, decide what to click, and click it. Great — until you already have an agent. Then you've got two brains fighting over who's in charge."],"features":["Deterministic — refs resolve through Playwright locators and bound DOM identities, one ref → one element. No coordinate guessing, no LLM re-interpreting targets between calls.","Cheap & fast — a text snapshot is a fraction of the tokens of a screenshot, and there's no vision API round-trip in the targeting loop.","Reliable — built on Playwright's auto-wait and locator engine, not homegrown DOM poking.","Yours to compose — no framework opinions, no agent loop, no hosted platform. Drop it into whatever architecture you already have."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/idan-rubin/browserclaw/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8819441a3eae01b7b494dfa5277069b491d7999af36cfc07ad8f17a471abe7a2","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T02:06:22.941Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:46.803Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The browser tool, not the agent. You bring the brain.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/idan-rubin/browserclaw/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"For a stable, shared profile across runs (persistent login state, preserved history), omit isolated and use profileName / userDataDir instead.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/idan-rubin/browserclaw/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"8819441a3eae01b7b494dfa5277069b491d7999af36cfc07ad8f17a471abe7a2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/idan-rubin/browserclaw/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:46.803Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T18:27:54Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/idan-rubin/browserclaw/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:46.805Z","hash":"8819441a3eae01b7b494dfa5277069b491d7999af36cfc07ad8f17a471abe7a2","originalBytes":41264,"storedBytes":41264,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:46.698Z","qualityPriority":false,"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T12:21:48.694Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T12:21:48.694Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/075d8c557210c046a1e12bc0.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-19T07:39:12.359Z","url":"https://browserclaw.org/"}],"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T02:06:15.118Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://browserc